GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_TeamRocketGrunt31Intro::
	.string "You’re not going any farther!\p"
	.string "I don’t show mercy to my enemies, not\n"
	.string "even brats!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_TeamRocketGrunt31Defeat::
	.string "Blast it!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_TeamRocketGrunt31::
	.string "I lost...\p"
	.string "Please forgive me, GIOVANNI!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_TeamRocketGrunt38Intro::
	.string "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\n"
	.string "I remember you!\p"
	.string "You got me good at our hideout!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_TeamRocketGrunt38Defeat::
	.string "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\n"
	.string "So, that’s how?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_TeamRocketGrunt38::
	.string "Hyuck-hyuck-hyuck!\n"
	.string "That was a blast!\l"
	.string "I’ll remember you!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_TeamRocketGrunt40Intro::
	.string "How did you get this far?\p"
	.string "I guess it can’t be helped. I’ll\n"
	.string "dispose of you.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_TeamRocketGrunt40Defeat::
	.string "He disposed of me...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_TeamRocketGrunt40::
	.string "TEAM ROCKET will keep going,\n"
	.string "waiting for the return of\l"
	.string "GIOVANNI.\p"
	.string "We’ll do whatever it takes.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_Gentleman_1::
	.string "DIRECTOR: Who? What?\n"
	.string "You came to rescue me?\p"
	.string "Thank you!\p"
	.string "The RADIO TOWER!\p"
	.string "What’s happening there?\p"
	.string "Taken over by TEAM ROCKET?\p"
	.string "Here. Take this CARD KEY.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_Gentleman_2::
	.string "DIRECTOR: Use that to open the\n"
	.string "shutters on 3F.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior18_Text_Gentleman_3::
	.string "I’m begging you to help.\p"
	.string "There’s no telling what they’ll do if\n"
	.string "they control the transmitter.\p"
	.string "They may even be able to control\n"
	.string "POKéMON using a special signal!\p"
	.string "You’re the only one I can call on.\p"
	.string "Please save the RADIO TOWER...\p"
	.string "And all the POKéMON nationwide!$"
